sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant TP as TerminalPane<br/>(EDT)
    participant SF as SessionFactory<br/>(EDT)
    participant CS as ConnectionService<br/>(EDT)
    participant CR as CredentialResolver<br/>(EDT)
    participant VM as VaultManager<br/>(EDT)
    participant W as SwingWorker<br/>(off-EDT)
    participant SS as SshSession
    participant AS as AgentSupport
    participant AG as ssh-agent
    participant RH as Remote sshd

    U->>TP: Drop SSH session on pane
    TP->>SF: createSshAsync(config)
    SF->>CS: connectAsync(config)
    CS->>CR: resolveCredentials(config)
    CR->>VM: unlock() if needed
    VM-->>CR: password (or empty)
    CS->>W: submit connect task
    W->>SS: open ClientSession
    SS->>AS: install agent identities
    AS->>AG: read identities (blocking I/O)
    AG-->>AS: identities
    SS->>RH: authenticate + open ChannelShell
    RH-->>SS: shell ready
    W-->>CS: SshSession (via done() on EDT)
    CS->>TP: setTtyConnector(SshTtyConnector)
